  "post_content": "<p>El Ateneo Mercantil y Cultural de Onda registr&oacute; anoche uno de sus llenos habituales en los &uacute;ltimos actos y el Grup de Jazz de la Onda Big Band no defraud&oacute;, con una hora y media de buena m&uacute;sica jazz&iacute;stica.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/03/IMG_0398.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Juan Fonfr&iacute;a a la guitarra, Manolo D&iacute;az a la trompeta y fliscorno, Mauricio Bedoya al bajo, Rub&eacute;n Franch a la bater&iacute;a y Dani Catal&aacute;n al vibr&aacute;fono fueron desgranando los temas de jaz cl&aacute;sico, cono el de Charli Parker, o dos bossa nova de Antonio Carlos Jobim, la segunda como bis ante los inistentes aplausos de las numerosas personas asistentes.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0386.jpg\" alt=\"img_0386\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0387.jpg\" alt=\"img_0387\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0388.jpg\" alt=\"img_0388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0390.jpg\" alt=\"img_0390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0391.jpg\" alt=\"img_0391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0392.jpg\" alt=\"img_0392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0393.jpg\" alt=\"img_0393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0394.jpg\" alt=\"img_0394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0395.jpg\" alt=\"img_0395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0396.jpg\" alt=\"img_0396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0397.jpg\" alt=\"img_0397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0398.jpg\" alt=\"img_0398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0399.jpg\" alt=\"img_0399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0400.jpg\" alt=\"img_0400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0402.jpg\" alt=\"img_0402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0404.jpg\" alt=\"img_0404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0405.jpg\" alt=\"img_0405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupjazzondaateneu/img_0406.jpg\" alt=\"img_0406\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
